===Adverb===
{{en-adv|-}}

# [[about#Preposition|About]] or [[near#Preposition|near]] that [[place#Noun|place]].
#: {{synonyms|en|thereabouts}}
# About or [[around#Preposition|around]] that [[date#Noun|date]] or [[time#Noun|time]].
#: {{synonyms|en|thereabouts}}
#: {{ux|en|Dinner will be ready at six-thirty or '''thereabout'''.}}
# About or near to that [[condition#Noun|condition]] or [[quality#Noun|quality]].
#: {{synonyms|en|thereabouts}}
# [[approximately|Approximately]] that [[number#Noun|number]] or [[quantity]].
#: {{synonyms|en|thereabouts}}
#: {{ux|en|The speed of light is 186,000 miles per second, right? Yes, '''thereabout'''.}}
# {{lb|en|obsolete}}
## About that; [[concerning]] that.
##: {{synonyms|en|thereabouts|q2=Scotland|thereanent}}
